{"2431080":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Blood Dungeon","steam_appid":2431080,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","dlc":[4994360],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood Dungeon is a feverish bullet heaven platformer from the creators of Nidhogg.  <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/b4f140f3f4a435ae3da7cdb7a60d6c29.poster.avif?t=1788324465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/b4f140f3f4a435ae3da7cdb7a60d6c29.webm?t=1788324465\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/b4f140f3f4a435ae3da7cdb7a60d6c29.mp4?t=1788324465\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and climb to avoid hordes of monsters. Duck and weave between enemies. Scramble up ladders, across grates, and over chains. Walls, ceilings, and even the watery depths are your domains to master.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/1c4c5a566f9bf4864982ef7394f05d10.poster.avif?t=1788324465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/1c4c5a566f9bf4864982ef7394f05d10.webm?t=1788324465\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/1c4c5a566f9bf4864982ef7394f05d10.mp4?t=1788324465\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The dungeons contain over 100 different enemies to kill. Bats. Centaurs. Exploding Eyeballs. Some fly through walls while others walk, stick, or bounce on them. Learn their movements, outsmart them, and harvest their blood.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/5a4a28848e7870e032ebb89226147679.poster.avif?t=1788324465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/5a4a28848e7870e032ebb89226147679.webm?t=1788324465\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/5a4a28848e7870e032ebb89226147679.mp4?t=1788324465\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your blood level to upgrade your build, or find chests hidden throughout the arenas.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/f8bc19a72ef6a78fecae75a788609e5e.poster.avif?t=1788324465\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/f8bc19a72ef6a78fecae75a788609e5e.webm?t=1788324465\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/2431080\/extras\/f8bc19a72ef6a78fecae75a788609e5e.mp4?t=1788324465\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circulate around the various drop sites to supplement your arsenal and master each arena.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><p cl